/**
 * Voice Intelligence — server functions (D327, Stream B backend).
 *
 * Implements the frozen cross-stream contract (signatures + zod schemas).
 * Stream C: import these functions for client calls and mock them in
 * tests — DO NOT edit this file (Stream B owns it).
 *
 * Honesty rules (do not weaken):
 * - Previews synthesize the resolved character's OWN provider voice via the
 *   ElevenLabs adapter directly — never the multi-provider fallback chain
 *   (a preview of Adam that comes back in another voice would be a silent
 *   substitution).
 * - Unmapped characters resolve to an explicit fallback (reported via
 *   `viaFallback`/`fallbackNote`) or fail with UNMAPPED_VOICE — never fake
 *   audio, never invented provider voice ids.
 * - All user-facing errors are friendly strings via friendlyTtsError() —
 *   never raw provider codes.
 */
